## 💻 Code Style

### JavaScript ONLY (NO TypeScript)
- ✅ `function Component({ prop })`
- ❌ `function Component({ prop }: Props)`
- ✅ `export function formatDate(dateString)`
- ❌ `export const formatDate: (dateString: string) => string`

### Imports
- Use `@/` alias: `import { foo } from '@/utils/foo'`
- Components: `import { Component } from '@/components/Component'`
- Utils: `import { util } from '@/utils/util'`

### Components
- Functional components with hooks
- **Fomantic UI CSS classes** (e.g., `ui button`, `ui grid`)
- **Sass for custom styles** (`.scss` files)
- NO Tailwind classes
- NO inline styles (`style={{}}`) unless absolutely necessary
- Semantic HTML (article, section, nav, etc.)

### Naming
- Components: PascalCase → `TabGroupe`, `MovieCard`
- Files: kebab-case → `tab-groupe.jsx`, `movie-card.jsx`
- Tests: kebab-case + suffix → `tab-groupe.cy.js`, `format.test.js`
- Utils: camelCase → `format.js`, `sanitize.js`

## 🌍 Internationalization (i18n)

### Locale Modules
- `lib/i18n/helpers.js` - Helper functions
- `lib/i18n/config.js` - Configuration
- `lib/i18n/resolver.js` - Locale resolver
- `lib/i18n/ui.json` - UI translations
- `lib/i18n/ratings.json` - Rating format translations

### Rules
- ✅ Preserve locale propagation through internal navigation
- ✅ Preserve current route when changing languages
- ✅ Reuse existing i18n modules (don't reinvent)
- ✅ Store UI translations in `lib/i18n/ui.json`
- ✅ Include locale in TMDB API requests

## 📦 Data Handling

### TMDB API
- ❌ Treat TMDB data as **unreliable** until validated
- ✅ Use TMDB service layer: `lib/services/tmdb-api.js`
- ✅ Validate with Zod schemas: `lib/schemas/`
- ✅ Preserve fallback behavior for missing data
- ✅ Remove duplicates when loading paginated data
- ✅ Include locale in TMDB requests

### Zod Validation
- ✅ Use Zod for runtime validation
- ✅ Validate external data, API responses, form input
- ✅ Import schemas from `lib/schemas/`

## 🚫 Forbidden Patterns

1. **NO TypeScript** - No `.ts`, `.tsx` files
2. **NO Tailwind CSS** - Use Fomantic UI + Sass only
3. **NO class components** - Functional + hooks only
4. **NO CSS selectors in tests** - Testing Library queries only
5. **NO direct API calls in components** - Use API routes or service layer
6. **NO `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`** - Except explicitly trusted content
7. **NO `.env` in git** - Use `.env.example` for template
8. **NO unvalidated external data** - Always use Zod

## ♿ Accessibility (WCAG 2.1 AA)

### Development Checklist
- [ ] All interactive elements keyboard accessible
- [ ] Focus indicators visible
- [ ] Images have `alt` text
- [ ] Forms have labels
- [ ] Errors announced to screen readers
- [ ] Color not sole information carrier
- [ ] Text contrast 4.5:1 minimum
- [ ] Headings in logical order
- [ ] Links descriptive
- [ ] Dynamic content announced (`aria-live`)

### Testing
- Run `cy.checkA11y()` (cypress-axe) on every page
- Test keyboard-only navigation
- Test with screen reader (NVDA/VoiceOver)
- Test zoom up to 200%
- Test color contrast

## 🔒 Security

### Development Checklist
- [ ] All user inputs sanitized
- [ ] API key server-side only (not in client)
- [ ] External URLs validated
- [ ] No `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` for user content
- [ ] Dependencies up to date (`npm audit`)

### Security Tests
- Input validation (XSS prevention)
- API key exposure checks
- Dependency vulnerability scans

