## 🔒 Git & Security

- NEVER commit `.env` files
- NEVER commit API keys or secrets
- Use `.env.example` as template
- Check `.gitignore` before committing
- Run `npm audit` regularly

## 🛠️ Locally Available Tools

Prefer these tools when available:
- `rg` (ripgrep) - Fast text searches
- `fd` - Fast file/directory search
- `fzf` - Interactive selection/filtering
- `bat` - Readable file output
- `delta` - Readable Git diffs
- `sd` - Simple text changes

